00:04:25.794 --> 00:04:28.075
As we honor National
Mental Wellness Month,

00:04:28.075 --> 00:04:29.974
remember to pick up "A
Tribute to The Judds"

00:04:29.974 --> 00:04:31.457
wherever you get your music.

00:04:31.457 --> 00:04:32.615
A portion of the proceeds

00:04:32.615 --> 00:04:35.655
